.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-BOX 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-box
.Nd seal a file of any size to an ML-KEM public key
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis box
.Fl p Ar key.pub
.Fl o Ar out
.Op Fl c Ar ctx
.Op Fl -chunk Ar bytes
.Op Fl f | Fl -force
.Ar file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis box
encrypts
.Ar file
(or standard input for
.Ar - )
so that only the holder of the secret key of
.Ar key.pub ,
an ML-KEM-512, -768 or -1024 key, can read it with
.Xr noqtis-unbox 1 ,
and writes the result to
.Ar out
(or standard output for
.Ar - ) .
The format is noqtis-kstream-1
.Pq Xr nqkfeini 3 :
a header holding an ML-KEM ciphertext, then the file in chunks, each
under ChaCha20-Poly1305 with its own nonce, so that changed, moved,
repeated or dropped chunks and a cut stream are all detected.
It reads and writes one chunk at a time, whatever the file's size.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl p Ar key.pub , Fl -pub Ns = Ns Ar key.pub
The recipient's ML-KEM public key file.
.It Fl o Ar out , Fl -out Ns = Ns Ar out
The output file, or
.Ar -
for standard output.
.It Fl c Ar ctx , Fl -ctx Ns = Ns Ar ctx
A context string (at most 255 bytes) that
.Xr noqtis-unbox 1
must be given too.
.It Fl -chunk Ar bytes
The chunk size, 1024 to 16777216 (default 65536).
.It Fl f , Fl -force
Replace an existing output file.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 2 on a usage, key or file error; an output file is
removed when the command fails.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ noqtis keygen -a ML-KEM-768 -o box
$ noqtis box -p box.pub -o data.nqk data.csv
$ noqtis unbox -k box -o data.csv data.nqk
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-keygen 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-unbox 1 ,
.Xr nqkfeini 3
